cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project or its data/certificates, please cite it."
title: "Extremal 72: searching for a [72,36,16] extremal Type II code"
abstract: >-
  A community-verifiable search to decide whether a binary doubly-even self-dual
  [72,36,16] code exists. Includes the forced weight-enumerator data, a finite
  length-40 residual menu, and exact, independently checkable reproduction
  bundles (Farkas/Smith/Delsarte certificates and exhaustive witnesses) for every
  proof-grade elimination.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
